---

This project benchmarks, but does not redistribute, the following:

* `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` — Apache-2.0. Downloaded at runtime
  from the Hugging Face Hub; not vendored here.

The ANE-optimised encoder layout in `bench/encoder.py` (channels-first
(B, C, 1, S) tensors, 1x1 Conv2d in place of Linear, per-head split attention)
follows the techniques published by Apple in `apple/ml-ane-transformers`
(Apache-2.0) and the accompanying article "Deploying Transformers on the Apple
Neural Engine". The implementation here is independent; the architectural
approach is theirs.
